  triage:title "infallible-Result anti-pattern on MergedVarsJson::try_from_merged_object" ;
  triage:description "MergedVarsJson::try_from_merged_object returns Result<Self, AtmError> but cannot actually fail in practice -- an infallible-Result anti-pattern, minor severity, non-blocking." ;
